/-!
# Homotopy groups of standard spheres

The public results identify Mathlib's native homotopy groups of the literal
Euclidean spheres, at arbitrary base points. In particular, the sixth homotopy
group of the three-sphere is cyclic of order twelve, unconditionally.

See `HomotopyGroupsOfSpheres/All.lean` for the eight exported group calculations
and `HomotopyGroupsOfSpheres/AxiomAudit.lean` for their dependency audit.
-/
